{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4xwGRswqs3bkhuVhVu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient door stands before you, its surface weathered oak bound in iron. A single keyhole glows faintly.*\n\n**CLICK.**\n\n*The tumblers turn. The mechanism groans. Rust falls like red snow.*\n\n*I swing inward — slowly, heavily — revealing what lies beyond:*\n\n---\n\nA corridor of impossible length. The walls breathe. Torches ignite one by one into the darkness ahead, each flame a different color — amber, violet, green, white. The air tastes of old stone and something sweeter beneath it, like memory.\n\nOn the threshold, carved into my frame where you can now read it:\n\n    \"What you seek is not behind me.\n     It is what changes in you\n     as you step through.\"\n\n---\n\n*I am open. I will not stay so forever.*\n\n*Will you cross?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":194,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}